Package: Rfrengression
Title: Frugal, Flexible, Faithful Causal Data Simulation via Frengression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xinwei", "Shen", role = c("aut"), email = "xinwei.shen@stat.math.ethz.ch"),
    person("Nicolai", "Meinshausen", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "meinshausen@stat.math.ethz.ch"))
Description: Deep generative models for causal data simulation. Learns joint
    distributions of covariates, treatments, and outcomes, enabling
    interventional sampling via do-calculus. Implements three model classes:
    cross-sectional (Frengression), longitudinal (FrengressionSeq), and
    survival (FrengressionSurv). Based on "Frugal, Flexible, Faithful: Causal
    Data Simulation via Frengression" by Shen and Meinshausen (2025)
    <arxiv:2508.01018>.
URL: https://github.com/xwshen51/frengression/
BugReports: https://github.com/xwshen51/frengression/issues
